  "disclaimer": "*This % may represent an aggregate of THC/CBD, THCa/CBDa, THCb/CBDb within the product. Consumers should review the actual product label for exact % of THC/CBD.",
  "description": "OMG Honey Berriez brings together the best of both worlds in this premium 3.5g hybrid flower. Perfectly balanced to deliver a harmonious blend of uplifting and relaxing effects, this strain offers a sweet, berry-forward flavor profile with honey-like undertones that make every session a treat. The vibrant buds showcase quality cultivation, providing smooth, flavorful smoke that appeals to both seasoned enthusiasts and newcomers alike. Expect a euphoric head high paired with gentle body relaxation—ideal for social gatherings, creative pursuits, or unwinding after a long day. The enticing aroma of fresh berries and sweet honey fills the air, making Honey Berriez a standout choice for those seeking flavorful, well-rounded cannabis. This pre-packaged flower maintains peak freshness and potency, ready to enjoy right out of the eighth.",
